#: resources/xnec2c.glade:9897
msgid ""
"Plots the average power gain over the directions the radiation pattern "
"samples, at each frequency.\n"
"Values appear once a frequency sweep with a radiation pattern has produced "
"results.\n"
"A sound lossless model averages 1.0 over the full sphere in free space and "
"2.0 over the upper hemisphere above perfect ground; a departure on such a "
"model points to inaccurate geometry, such as segments too long or wires too "
"close.\n"
"The readout adds the sampled fraction of the sphere and the average scaled "
"by that fraction, in percent, which reads 100 for a sound lossless model "
"whose pattern covers every direction it radiates into.\n"
"See the \"Validating a Model\" section of the manual for how to run and read "
"the test."
msgstr ""
"Stip die gemiddelde kragaanwins oor die rigtings wat die stralingspatroon "
"bemonster, by elke frekwensie.\n"
"Waardes verskyn sodra 'n frekwensieveeg met 'n stralingspatroon resultate "
"gelewer het.\n"
"'n Gesonde verliesvrye model gee 'n gemiddelde van 1,0 oor die volle sfeer "
"in vrye ruimte en 2,0 oor die boonste halfsfeer bo perfekte grond; 'n "
"afwyking by só 'n model dui op onakkurate geometrie, soos te lang segmente "
"of drade wat te naby aanmekaar is.\n"
"Die uitlesing voeg die bemonsterde breukdeel van die sfeer by, asook die "
"gemiddelde geskaleer met daardie breukdeel, in persent, wat 100 lees vir 'n "
"gesonde verliesvrye model waarvan die patroon elke rigting dek waarin dit "
"straal.\n"
"Sien die afdeling \"Validating a Model\" van die handleiding vir hoe om die "
"toets uit te voer en te lees."

#: resources/xnec2c.glade:9912
msgid "Cond"
msgstr "Kond."

#: resources/xnec2c.glade:9916
msgid ""
"Plots the precision lost solving the antenna at each frequency, in decimal "
"digits.\n"
"Values appear once a frequency sweep has produced results.\n"
"Read it against the impedance and VSWR traces: a flat low curve means those "
"traces are sound, while a peak marks a frequency where the solve degraded, "
"so a sharp impedance excursion at that same frequency is a numerical "
"artefact rather than a resonance.\n"
"A double carries about 15 digits, so a reading of 3 leaves 12 sound ones and "
"a reading near 15 leaves none; shorten or thicken the offending segments and "
"run the sweep again to bring the curve down.\n"
"See the \"Validating a Model\" section of the manual to read it beside the "
"AGT trace."
msgstr ""
"Stip die presisie wat verlore gaan by die oplos van die antenna by elke "
"frekwensie, in desimale syfers.\n"
"Waardes verskyn sodra 'n frekwensieveeg resultate gelewer het.\n"
"Lees dit teenoor die impedansie- en VSWR-spore: 'n plat lae kurwe beteken "
"dié spore is betroubaar, terwyl 'n piek 'n frekwensie aandui waar die "
"oplossing verswak het, sodat 'n skerp impedansie-uitwyking by dieselfde "
"frekwensie 'n numeriese artefak is en nie 'n resonansie nie.\n"
"'n Dubbelpresisiegetal dra ongeveer 15 syfers, sodat 'n lesing van 3 nog 12 "
"betroubare syfers laat en 'n lesing naby 15 geen; verkort of verdik die "
"betrokke segmente en voer die veeg weer uit om die kurwe te laat sak.\n"
"Sien die afdeling \"Validating a Model\" van die handleiding om dit langs "
"die AGT-spoor te lees."

