#: src/mathlib.c:1186
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"* Notice: \"%s\" was selected, but you can only change to a\n"
"* different Intel MKL threading library by restarting xnec2c.\n"
"* \n"
"* However, you may continue to select any other Linear Algebra library\n"
"* without restart, including this same Intel MKL library.  All other\n"
"* Intel MKL threading libraries are disabled until restart because of an \n"
"* MKL limitation where the MKL threading library can only be dynamically\n"
"* linked only once per runtime.\n"
"* \n"
"* See Intel's documentation on mkl_set_threading_layer() for more detail.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"* Kennisgewing: \"%s\" is gekies, maar jy kan slegs na 'n\n"
"* ander Intel MKL-draadbiblioteek verander deur xnec2c te herbegin.\n"
"* \n"
"* Jy kan egter enige ander Lineêre Algebra-biblioteek kies\n"
"* sonder herbegin, insluitend hierdie selfde Intel MKL-biblioteek. Alle "
"ander\n"
"* Intel MKL-draadbiblioteke is gedeaktiveer tot herbegin weens 'n\n"
"* MKL-beperking waar die MKL-draadbiblioteek slegs een keer per\n"
"* looptyd dinamies gekoppel kan word.\n"
"* \n"
"* Sien Intel se dokumentasie oor mkl_set_threading_layer() vir meer "
"besonderhede.\n"

